note we need to discuss A and D.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: mention that while C's reliability and calmness are strong, his communication difficulty and egocentric attitude are concerns, but B also has cooperation issues. Also bring up A and D facts: A's unorganized and unfriendly, D's weak leadership and moodiness. Suggest we need to discuss them. Vote for C.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
